    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icekai is a 2D sokoban-style puzzle game that emphasizes it\u00b4s gameplay on pathfinding and creating the circumstances for the right positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp mind is essential for getting the minimum amount of moves required to beat a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content of the Full Icekai Game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-One player Puzzle game with over 100 stages and  at least six worlds with lots of secrets.</p>",
